{"4146620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Riftbound Survivors", "steam_appid": 4146620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ANNIHILATE THE SWARM</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riftbound is a survivor-like bullet heaven built around build customization and massive enemy density. Wipe out thousands of entities with automated attacks, refine your build on the fly, and adapt to a constantly ramping difficulty curve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146620/extras/688aef91bb70b8ab827675781c63268e.poster.avif?t=1781787744\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146620/extras/688aef91bb70b8ab827675781c63268e.webm?t=1781787744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146620/extras/688aef91bb70b8ab827675781c63268e.mp4?t=1781787744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAIN REACTIONS &amp; SPARK COMBOS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your abilities are designed to interact, allowing you to create chaotic screen-clearing combos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Interplay:</strong> Mix contrasting elements to trigger massive area damage. Freeze a dense pack of enemies with a blizzard, then shatter them instantly with a kinetic shockwave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overlapping Effects:</strong> Combine different weapon behaviors and status effects. Stack heavy area-of-effect burns with high-frequency knockbacks to trap enemies in deadly choke points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Chaos:</strong> Push your build to the limit until the screen is filled with hundreds of active projectiles and status chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146620/extras/998c32548d6cedf6eb2c96d0169aa2da.poster.avif?t=1781787744\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146620/extras/998c32548d6cedf6eb2c96d0169aa2da.webm?t=1781787744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146620/extras/998c32548d6cedf6eb2c96d0169aa2da.mp4?t=1781787744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE AND ESCALATE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Archetypes:</strong> Build your character your way. Choose from heavy melee weapons with high kinetic force to magic staves firing automated homing missiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta-Progression:</strong> Collect Essence during your runs to permanently upgrade base attributes and expand your starting weapon pool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional Co-op:</strong> Enter the Rift solo or team up with a partner. Coordinate your loadouts to cover each other's weaknesses, draw aggression, or execute a high-risk revive in the middle of a horde.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ANNIHILATE THE SWARM</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riftbound is a survivor-like bullet heaven built around build customization and massive enemy density. Wipe out thousands of entities with automated attacks, refine your build on the fly, and adapt to a constantly ramping difficulty curve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146620/extras/688aef91bb70b8ab827675781c63268e.poster.avif?t=1781787744\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146620/extras/688aef91bb70b8ab827675781c63268e.webm?t=1781787744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146620/extras/688aef91bb70b8ab827675781c63268e.mp4?t=1781787744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAIN REACTIONS &amp; SPARK COMBOS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your abilities are designed to interact, allowing you to create chaotic screen-clearing combos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Interplay:</strong> Mix contrasting elements to trigger massive area damage. Freeze a dense pack of enemies with a blizzard, then shatter them instantly with a kinetic shockwave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overlapping Effects:</strong> Combine different weapon behaviors and status effects. Stack heavy area-of-effect burns with high-frequency knockbacks to trap enemies in deadly choke points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Chaos:</strong> Push your build to the limit until the screen is filled with hundreds of active projectiles and status chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146620/extras/998c32548d6cedf6eb2c96d0169aa2da.poster.avif?t=1781787744\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146620/extras/998c32548d6cedf6eb2c96d0169aa2da.webm?t=1781787744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146620/extras/998c32548d6cedf6eb2c96d0169aa2da.mp4?t=1781787744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE AND ESCALATE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Archetypes:</strong> Build your character your way. Choose from heavy melee weapons with high kinetic force to magic staves firing automated homing missiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta-Progression:</strong> Collect Essence during your runs to permanently upgrade base attributes and expand your starting weapon pool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional Co-op:</strong> Enter the Rift solo or team up with a partner. Coordinate your loadouts to cover each other's weaknesses, draw aggression, or execute a high-risk revive in the middle of a horde.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Riftbound is a survivor-like bullet heaven focused on spell combinations and massive enemy waves. Defeat thousands of enemies, experiment with elemental chain reactions, and break the game with overlapping status effects. Play solo or in co-op.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146620/d0be39878dc20a73ce3a2347423c1e48ed1047de/header.jpg?t=1781787744", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146620/0e0d6993f80124c6332ef9a45c4cba2b8dd96225/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781787744", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146620/0e0d6993f80124c6332ef9a45c4cba2b8dd96225/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781787744", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memor